      "kind": "note",
      "text": "A structural proposal names its measure before it is posted: say exactly how a 'peak' (or any position) is computed on the engine's page plan, check it against the current blueprints of that mode, and say what share already passes; a rule that every existing blueprint fails is an experiment or guidance, not a rule.",
